      "name": "Cache Invalidation",
      "description": {
        "content": "Sometimes a cache might contain stale data, or it may just need to be cleared because of an invalid configuration. This call will purge all keys associated with a cache on an API-by-API basis.\n",
        "type": "text/plain"
      },
